From: RDK Build Compatibility
Subject: [PATCH] bash: declare list_reverse argument

GCC 15 treats the old no-argument declaration as a prototype and rejects
the call that passes the list argument. Declare the actual argument type.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/externs.h
+++ b/externs.h
@@ -124 +124 @@
-extern GENERIC_LIST *list_reverse ();
+extern GENERIC_LIST *list_reverse __P((GENERIC_LIST *));
